notes.body:
What do you think it would be the best approach to split the MR?

Keep the commits in order and add support for `BLF_OBJTYPE_LIN_MESSAGE2` (wrongly copying the approach to `BLF_OBJTYPE_LIN_MESSAGE`) and then fix everything (less work overall);

Or first fix `BLF_OBJTYPE_LIN_MESSAGE` and then add support for `BLF_OBJTYPE_LIN_MESSAGE2` correctly (requires some manual work and can't be done only with git).

